abstract: "A machine-readable metrology of a recorded dataset: every variable as a distribution over its true time and value, with the clocks, models and studies behind it; compiled to one JSON file and a website. Includes the VitalDB atlas as its first dataset."
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/metrology-atlas/metrology-atlas"
url: "https://vitaldb.metrology-atlas.org"
keywords:
